<view class="page">
  <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">合</view><view><view class="brand-name">合拍</view><view class="muted">AI 交友匹配助手</view></view></view>
  <view class="eyebrow">真人匹配</view>
  <view class="title">找到聊得来的人</view>
  <view class="muted">可以直接浏览匹配演示，也可以自愿和 AI 聊聊。</view>
  <view class="notice">演示模式：候选资料均为虚构样例，不是真人。注册、真人匹配、AI 服务和支付尚未接入。</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">匹配筛选</view>
    <text class="field-label">年龄区间</text>
    <view class="row"><input class="input age-input" type="number" value="{{ageMin}}" bindinput="onAgeMin"/><text>至</text><input class="input age-input" type="number" value="{{ageMax}}" bindinput="onAgeMax"/><text>岁</text></view>
    <text class="field-label">城市</text>
    <picker class="picker" mode="selector" range="{{cities}}" value="{{cityIndex}}" bindchange="onCityChange"><view>{{cities[cityIndex]}}</view></picker>
    <view class="footer-note">这里只在本机筛选演示资料。真实同城匹配需要用户授权、正式账号和服务端用户池。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" style="justify-content:space-between"><view class="section-title">推荐样例</view><view class="muted small">{{shownCount}} 个演示资料</view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{visibleMatches}}" wx:key="id" class="candidate">
      <view class="candidate-head"><view class="avatar">{{item.emoji}}</view><view><view class="candidate-name">{{item.name}} · {{item.age}}岁</view><view class="muted">{{item.city}} · 虚构演示资料</view></view></view>
      <view class="tags"><text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this" class="tag">{{tag}}</text></view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.intro}}</view>
      <button class="btn light full" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onReport">举报入口演示</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{visibleMatches.length===0}}" class="notice">当前筛选条件下没有演示资料，请调整年龄或城市。</view>
    <button class="btn full" bindtap="onMatch">{{matchStarted ? '换一批演示资料' : '直接匹配'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">权益价格预览</view>
    <view class="list-row"><text>每日随机匹配</text><text class="price">10 次</text></view>
    <view class="list-row"><text>额外匹配</text><text class="price">¥1 / 2 次</text></view>
    <view class="list-row"><text>VIP</text><text class="price">¥15 / 30 天</text></view>
    <view class="list-row"><text>AI 聊天</text><text class="price">需有余额</text></view>
    <view class="notice">价格仅为原型展示，购买与扣款尚未接入。AI 聊天按实际使用量收费，正式开放前会明确展示用户收费标准。</view>
  </view>
</view>
